&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guidde is an AI digital adoption platform that serves as the creation and consumption hub for modern organizations. Founded in 2020 by seasoned entrepreneurs, we use generative AI to transform workflows into rich, multi-format documentation in minutes. Our platform helps teams scale knowledge across employees, customers, and even AI systems, turning everyday processes into instant, in-app video guiddes that live where work actually happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 4,500 organizations worldwide, from fast-growing startups to Fortune 500 enterprises, rely on Guidde to reduce support load, accelerate onboarding, and make knowledge accessible on demand.&amp;nbsp;We&#39;re building the future of how knowledge is created, shared, and experienced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ideal &quot;Guidder&quot; is like our platform - clear, impactful, and focused on delivering value. We blend a startup environment with sports team principles - strategic in planning, collaborative in execution, and obsessed with customer wins. We value doers who listen more than they talk and who show up ready to play their best game. Ready to make your mark on our roster? Go Guidde!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a sharp, curious closer who thrives in complex deals, earns trust with multi-stakeholder buyers, and wants to sell a product that genuinely makes people&#39;s work lives better — then your place is with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full commercial sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt; — manage every stage from discovery through demo to close across a pipeline of mid-market and commercial accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead discovery and run compelling demos&lt;/strong&gt; — deeply understand prospect needs, navigate multi-stakeholder buying processes, and align Guidde&#39;s value to real business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive and close complex deals&lt;/strong&gt; — manage longer sales cycles involving legal, security, and procurement, keeping deals moving with structure and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nurture accounts toward growth&lt;/strong&gt; — cultivate relationships with existing users exploring expanded adoption, supporting a land-and-expand motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI across your workflow&lt;/strong&gt; — actively use AI tools to research, prepare, and communicate — treating them as a genuine competitive advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to playbook development&lt;/strong&gt; — collaborate with the team on process experimentation, sharing what&#39;s working and helping refine the sales motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you need to have?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years in B2B SaaS sales&lt;/strong&gt; — with meaningful closing experience and a track record of owning deals end-to-end, not just top-of-funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience selling to mid-market organizations&lt;/strong&gt; — comfortable navigating deals with companies of 200+ employees, including some at the 1,000+ scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex deal experience&lt;/strong&gt; — has handled 30+ day sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders, legal reviews, and procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant SaaS category background&lt;/strong&gt; — prior experience selling workflow, documentation, enablement, or an adjacent software product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency&lt;/strong&gt; — actively using AI tools in day-to-day work and able to speak credibly about how it improves their output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Startup mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — comfortable operating without a fully built playbook, able to show career progression and a builder&#39;s mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to a formal sales methodology frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience nurturing or expanding accounts beyond the initial close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of selling into multiple industries — you appreciate breadth over a narrow niche&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your journey with Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leave Your Mark:&lt;/strong&gt; Own a commercial book of business from day one and help shape the sales motion at a company defining its category&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Your Way (Hybrid):&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy a flexible work arrangement based in New York&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with your manager and peers to experiment on the playbook and contribute to how Guidde goes to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel Your Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Access opportunities to advance as Guidde scales — this is a ground-floor moment at a company with real traction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Value Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a competitive compensation and benefits package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The salary range for this position is $200,000 - $220,000 OTE + equity and benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire talented and passionate people from a variety of backgrounds because we want our global employee base to represent the wide diversity of our customers. If you&#39;re excited about a role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with every bullet point listed in the job description, we still encourage you to apply. If you&#39;re a builder at heart, share our company values, and enthusiastic about making software toolmaking ubiquitous, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guidde is an AI digital adoption platform that serves as the creation and consumption hub for modern organizations. Founded in 2020 by seasoned entrepreneurs, we use generative AI to transform workflows into rich, multi-format documentation in minutes. Our platform helps teams scale knowledge across employees, customers, and even AI systems, turning everyday processes into instant, in-app video guiddes that live where work actually happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 5,000 organizations worldwide, from fast-growing startups to Fortune 500 enterprises, rely on Guidde to reduce support load, accelerate onboarding, and make knowledge accessible on demand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building the future of knowledge creation, sharing, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ideal &quot;Guidder&quot; is like our platform - clear, impactful, and focused on delivering value. We blend a startup environment with sports team principles - strategic in planning, collaborative in execution, and obsessed with customer wins. We value doers who listen more than they talk and who show up ready to play their best game. Ready to make your mark on our roster? Go Guidde!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a product leader who takes full ownership, sets direction, sweats the details, loves to create, and is driven to build experiences that people genuinely love using, then your place is with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Guidde’s core creation experience&lt;/strong&gt; – Define vision and roadmap for the capture-and-edit flow that sits at the heart of the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design seamless cross-platform journeys&lt;/strong&gt; – Improve the creation experience across Chrome extension, desktop, and web, removing friction at every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay deeply connected to users&lt;/strong&gt; – Run interviews, feedback sessions, and continuous discovery to understand real user needs and behaviors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn data into decisions&lt;/strong&gt; – Define success metrics, track performance, and use insights to guide fast, confident product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI where it adds real value&lt;/strong&gt; – Identify where intelligent capabilities improve the experience and bring them into production effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional execution&lt;/strong&gt; – Work closely with engineering, design, and GTM teams to deliver high-impact product outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you need to have?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of product management experience&lt;/strong&gt; – Owning product areas end-to-end, from strategy through execution and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Startup DNA&lt;/strong&gt; – You&#39;ve built in a small, fast-moving team where ownership was real, pace was high, and you wore multiple hats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise experience&lt;/strong&gt; – You&#39;ve built for or sold to enterprise customers and understand the unique constraints and expectations that come with it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong user-centric mindset&lt;/strong&gt; – Consistent experience conducting research and validating decisions through real user interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering proximity&lt;/strong&gt; – You came from a technical background or have spent meaningful time working hand-in-hand with large R&amp;amp;D teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience building AI-powered features&lt;/strong&gt; – You can describe a concrete, tangible example of something you built or shipped using AI — not a generic answer, but a real deliverable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A technical background - you came from engineering or spent meaningful time working closely with a large R&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building creation tools, productivity products, or user workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with product-led growth (PLG) motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your journey with Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leave Your Mark:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and shape the core experience that defines Guidde’s product&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Your Way (Hybrid):&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy a flexible work arrangement based in Tel Aviv&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with Engineering, Design, and GTM teams on a product used globally&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel Your Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow into a senior product leadership role as the company scales&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Value Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a competitive compensation and benefits package&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire talented and passionate people from a variety of backgrounds because we want our global employee base to represent the wide diversity of our customers. If you&#39;re excited about this role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with every bullet point listed, we still encourage you to apply. If you&#39;re a builder at heart, share our company values, and are enthusiastic about making software toolmaking ubiquitous, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;6:1-6:445;69-513&quot;&gt;Guidde is an AI digital adoption platform that serves as the creation and consumption hub for modern organizations. Founded in 2021 by seasoned entrepreneurs, we use generative AI to transform workflows into rich, multi-format documentation in minutes. Our platform helps teams scale knowledge across employees, customers, and even AI systems, turning everyday processes into instant, in-app video guiddes that live where work actually happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;8:1-8:199;515-713&quot;&gt;More than 5,000 organizations worldwide, from fast-growing startups to Fortune 500 enterprises, rely on Guidde to reduce support load, accelerate onboarding, and make knowledge accessible on demand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:80;715-794&quot;&gt;We&#39;re building the future of how knowledge is created, shared, and experienced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:382;796-1177&quot;&gt;The Ideal &quot;Guidder&quot; is like our platform - clear, impactful, and focused on delivering value. We blend a startup environment with sports team principles - strategic in planning, collaborative in execution, and obsessed with customer wins. We value doers who listen more than they talk and who show up ready to play their best game. Ready to make your mark on our roster? Go Guidde!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:194;1179-1372&quot;&gt;If you are a data detective who&#39;s happiest when a hunch turns into a validated answer - someone who&#39;d rather report an inconclusive result than a comfortable story - then your place is with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:34;1374-1407&quot;&gt;How will your day-to-day look?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-22:133;1409-2433&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:268;1409-1676&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve real GTM puzzles&lt;/strong&gt; — Answer the questions Sales, CS, Marketing, and Leadership actually lose sleep over: what predicts a high-value customer, which companies to target for Enterprise, where the best upsell opportunities are, and what&#39;s really driving churn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:226;1677-1902&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale insights with AI-powered workflows&lt;/strong&gt; — Use LLMs and AI agents, including our custom Squidde AI, to automate analyses and enrich data with external signals, generating insight at a pace no manual process could match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:184;1903-2086&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go exploring&lt;/strong&gt; — Dig into the data without waiting to be asked. Surface patterns and questions nobody thought to raise, and build your own processes to help teams hit their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:214;2087-2300&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner directly with GTM teams&lt;/strong&gt; — Sit with Sales, CS, Marketing, and Growth to understand what&#39;s actually blocking them, turn that into sharp analytical questions, and come back with answers they can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:133;2301-2433&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and evolve the data models&lt;/strong&gt; — Design new models, improve what&#39;s already there, and expand coverage as the business grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:43;2435-2477&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive in this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-31:129;2479-3350&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:136;2479-2614&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ years in data analytics or similar&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— With a track record of driving business-oriented outcomes, not just technical output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:133;2615-2747&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong technical toolkit&lt;/strong&gt; — Advanced SQL for navigating complex datasets, plus Python (or similar) for analysis and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:167;2748-2914&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical integrity&lt;/strong&gt; — You&#39;re an independent operator who reports what the data actually shows, pushes the bar higher, and doesn&#39;t wait around for instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:157;2915-3071&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM and business fluency&lt;/strong&gt; — Solid grasp of marketing, sales, and growth data, including core SaaS metrics like CAC, LTV, churn, and conversion funnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:150;3072-3221&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A workflow built around modern tools&lt;/strong&gt; — You use LLMs as a natural part of how you work, understanding where they help and where they fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:129;3222-3350&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sharp communication&lt;/strong&gt; — You turn technical findings into clear business narratives and work well with people across the org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:28;3352-3379&quot;&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-37:76;3381-3589&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;36:1-36:46;3468-3513&quot;&gt;Familiarity with BigQuery, Metabase, or dbt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;37:1-37:76;3514-3589&quot;&gt;Experience building or integrating AI agents into data analysis workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:28;3591-3618&quot;&gt;Your journey with Guidde&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-45:83;3620-4271&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:152;3620-3771&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leave Your Mark:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape how Guidde understands its customers, from spotting the next Enterprise target to defining what &quot;high-value&quot; really means.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:91;3772-3862&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Your Way (Hybrid):&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy a flexible work arrangement based in Tel Aviv, Israel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;43:1-43:180;3863-4042&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Team up with the data team and GTM stakeholders to build AI-powered analysis workflows that scale insight beyond what any one analyst could produce alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-44:146;4043-4188&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel Your Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Access opportunities to deepen your expertise in AI-driven analytics and grow into a strategic voice across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;45:1-45:83;4189-4271&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Value Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a competitive compensation and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;47:1-47:472;4273-4744&quot;&gt;We hire talented and passionate people from a variety of backgrounds because we want our global employee base to represent the wide diversity of our customers. If you&#39;re excited about a role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with every bullet point listed in the job description, we still encourage you to apply. If you&#39;re a builder at heart, share our company values, and enthusiastic about making software toolmaking ubiquitous, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guidde is an AI digital adoption platform that serves as the hub for the creation and consumption of modern organizations. Founded in 2021 by seasoned entrepreneurs, we use generative AI to transform workflows into rich, multi-format documentation in minutes. Our platform helps teams scale knowledge across employees, customers, and even AI systems, turning everyday processes into instant, in-app video guiddes that live where work actually happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 5,000 organizations worldwide, from fast-growing startups to Fortune 500 enterprises, rely on Guidde to reduce support load, accelerate onboarding, and make knowledge accessible on demand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building the future of knowledge creation, sharing, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ideal &quot;Guidder&quot; is like our platform - clear, impactful, and focused on delivering value. We blend a startup environment with sports team principles - strategic in planning, collaborative in execution, and obsessed with customer wins. We value doers who listen more than they talk and who show up ready to play their best game. Ready to make your mark on our roster? Go Guidde!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are someone who gets genuine satisfaction from turning a complex product feature into a two-minute video that clicks, and you’re excited about how AI assistants can help streamline processes for both customers and support agents, then your place is with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will You Do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Produce educational content&lt;/strong&gt; — Create engaging video tutorials using Guidde and clear written documentation that keeps pace with every product update&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize for humans and AI alike&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape content for both human comprehension and AI-powered support, monitoring AI support interactions to spot gaps and improvement areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; — Work closely with Product, Customer Success, and Support to keep enablement efforts aligned with the product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the help center&lt;/strong&gt; — Organize and maintain a comprehensive help center, with regular reviews and updates to keep it accurate and useful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move fast on new features&lt;/strong&gt; — Follow established content workflows and standards to deliver rapid, reliable content for every new release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement or content experience&lt;/strong&gt; — 2+ years in customer enablement, education, or content creation, ideally alongside prior experience in a customer-facing role like support or customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content creation examples — &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated experience creating effective educational content, supported by examples of written and video work.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool fluency&lt;/strong&gt; — Comfort with content management systems and video creation tools (bonus points if that includes Guidde)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sharp attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt; — Strong analytical skills with a clear focus on content optimization and quality&lt;/li&gt;
